- **browser**: Claude Chrome is a separate Chrome with its own logins (`~/.chrome-claude`, 127.0.0.1:__BROWSER_PORT__). Use `chrome-devtools-axi` (skill of the same name) for browser tasks, never my everyday Chrome. Extra browsers from `BROWSER_EXTRA` in harness.env each have a `chrome-<id>` command; sites listed in `__PROFILE_DIR__/browser/<id>-sites.txt` belong in that browser, and a hook blocks them in Claude Chrome. I log in and type passwords and 2FA myself. Status: `__HARNESS_DIR__/modules/browser/install.sh --status`.
